<title>USA: PUCO oks rate increase for Cinergy unit.</title>
<headline>PUCO oks rate increase for Cinergy unit.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI, Ohio 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cinergy Corp said on Thursday that the Public Utilities Commission of Ohio approved a $9.2 million, or 2.5 percent, annual increase in gas revenues for the Cincinnati Gas &amp; Electric Co, a unit of Cinergy.</p>
<p>The company said it originally requested an increase of $30.8 million, or 8.8 percent, when it filed its case in January, 1996.</p>
